<title>HONG KONG: TNT Express appoints marketing director for Asia.</title>
<headline>TNT Express appoints marketing director for Asia.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>TNT Express Worldwide said on Monday it had appointed Richard Beere as regional director of marketing for the Asia-Pacific region.</p>
<p>Beere, who previously managed local operations in TNT's Singapore office, will now be responsible for developing the strategic marketing plans for Asia, Australia and New Zealand, the global express distribution company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News1room (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
